  "description": "…I like you. I like you a lot.\n\nThe talk of the town, the famous confession post that was uploaded anonymously. Daon knows intuitively that the post is directed towards him, but he has no idea who wrote it. The upperclassman that only takes care of me? My only female friend? Or the lunatic keep bumping into?\n\nI have no idea. Everyone is suspicious!!\n\n(Source: NETCOMICS)",
